Recover pods after suspended SSH connections

Retire unresponsive OpenSSH control masters after a bounded probe so a
resumed daemon can establish a fresh transport. Reset active pod proxy
streams and Codex frontends when their host disconnects. This lets every
pod reconnect instead of retaining silently stalled children.

Enable rumpelpod INFO logs in the generated systemd user service. Log
host and pod connection transitions needed to diagnose future outages.
